Package: katu-ai
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Katu OS Team <katuos@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt5 | python3-pyside6, katu-core, katu-release
Priority: optional
Section: misc
Description: Katu AI — AI Assistant for all users
 AI assistant application for Katu OS end users.
 Supports multiple providers: OpenAI (ChatGPT), Claude (Anthropic),
 Google Gemini, and local models via Ollama. Uses BYOK (Bring Your
 Own Key) — no keys are bundled or hardcoded. Keys stored securely
 in user home directory (permission 600). Action Registry prevents
 arbitrary command execution from AI responses.
